OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 26 Oct to Wed 4 Nov
OL,6,FContinuing unsettled into the early
OL,7,Fpart of next week with an Atlantic
OL,8,Ffrontal system expected to bring
OL,9,Fanother spell of wet and windy
OL,10,Fweather. Through the course of next
OL,11,Fweek, conditions likely turning less
OL,12,Funsettled with rain and stronger winds
OL,13,Fbecoming more focused on northwestern
OL,14,Fareas. Likely turning drier and calmer
OL,15,Facross the south and east bringing a
OL,16,Fgreater chance of chilly nights and
OL,17,Fmorning fog patches. A similar pattern
OL,18,Fthen likely continuing during early
OL,19,FNovember though with a chance that
OL,20,Fsettled conditions may develop more
OL,21,Fwidely for a time. Temperatures
OL,22,Fvarying around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
