PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1792594126
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 5 Nov to Thu 19 Nov
OL,6,FSlowly evolving weather patterns are
OL,7,Fmore likely than normal during early
OL,8,Fin November which increase the chance
OL,9,Fof spells of settled and drier
OL,10,Fweather. Most areas are still likely
OL,11,Fto see some rain or showers at times
OL,12,Fbut the focus of these more likely
OL,13,Facross the northwest of the UK. Into
OL,14,Fmid-November, the chances of a more
OL,15,Funsettled weather regime increases
OL,16,Fagain with more frequent spells of
OL,17,Frain for many areas and likely windy
OL,18,Fat times. Some cold nights possible
OL,19,Fduring more settled spells, otherwise
OL,20,Ftemperatures likely to vary around
OL,21,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
